WEBVTT

00:24.623 --> 00:29.044
You learned to live in shifting sands With no

00:29.064 --> 00:33.885
safe place to ever land You learned that doors

00:34.125 --> 00:39.006
could slam and lock Against the ticking of the

00:39.066 --> 00:45.255
clock You learn to touch could be a cage A quiet

00:45.355 --> 00:50.897
simmering bit of rage But that old world is dead

00:50.917 --> 00:55.518
and gone It's time to face a brand new dawn So let

00:55.578 --> 01:02.040
my arms be your new one To catch you every time you

01:02.100 --> 01:07.302
fall This heart of stands, it will not break For

01:07.342 --> 01:12.805
your own precious, gentle sake If it's a heart

01:12.885 --> 01:18.027
that you should need A simple, pure, loving

01:18.127 --> 01:22.548
creed Then I am here, my love is true

01:26.255 --> 01:30.823
My arms will be a home for you.

01:53.075 --> 01:58.018
No need to brace, no need to hide With your two

01:58.098 --> 02:03.602
sisters by your side We'll be the lock, we'll be

02:03.642 --> 02:10.807
the key To your own safe reality We'll be the roof

02:10.927 --> 02:16.911
against the rain To wash away the hurt and pain

02:17.111 --> 02:20.374
This is a vow we'll always keep

02:24.088 --> 02:29.381
While you are in your troubled sleep

